VU1: the debug and recording code that copies the whole interpreter (GOW_VU1_STARTMAC, GOW_VU1N_VERIFY in VU1Interpreter::run; GOW_VU1N_RECORD / GOW_VU1N_REPLAY in recordReplay; the task recorder in recordTask) runs in its own out-of-line lambda frame. Those three functions run for every VU1 program; inline, the copies gave run() a 202 KB stack frame and the two recorders large ones too, each probed page by page by ___chkstk_ms on every call, recording or not: 2.3% of the VU1 worker in combat (save route profile), 0% after. No behaviour change (replay 0 differ).

